WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.450
In a physical change the particles move, but stay the same particles.

2
00:00:05.425 --> 00:00:09.000
Ice: water particles vibrating in fixed places.

3
00:00:11.079 --> 00:00:15.354
Warmer, the same particles slide past each other. Liquid water.

4
00:00:16.417 --> 00:00:20.092
Hotter still, the same particles fly apart. Steam.

5
00:00:20.818 --> 00:00:24.693
No new particles, so no new substance: a physical change.
